Ditto Streaming API

Includes inference code from Ant Group's Ditto project:
https://github.com/antgroup/ditto-talkinghead
Upstream commit: c3e47eee2e626500017a0556b470d6d4182f85e8
Vendored code: vendor/ditto/ (Apache License 2.0; original LICENSE retained).

Local modifications inherited from the working prototype:
- Cython cache output located under the vendored package's .cache directory.
- Mouth expression strength with smoothing in MotionStitch.
New modification:
- Overall source-to-driven keypoint motion intensity with smoothing,
  applied after stitching in MotionStitch.__call__.
New service code: ditto_api/, web/, scripts/, tests/.

Model weights are not included. Bundled upstream model repositories and
third-party components can have separate terms. In particular, InsightFace
pretrained model terms require review before commercial deployment.
No user portraits, recorded audio, generated videos, credentials or local
GPU environments are intended to be distributed with the source repository.
